        <h3>Microsoft Outage</h3>
      </div>
        <p>At this time, if you were trying to reach us via email, Microsoft Outlook and other Microsoft 365 Services remain impacted. If you are in need of assistance, you can reach us by phone. Visit our <a href="/directory">Department Phone Directory</a> for a full list of phone numbers. In-person services continue during business hours. We apologize for the inconvenience and thank you for understanding.</p>
