    <div class="uk-modal-dialog">
      <a class="uk-modal-close uk-close"></a>
      <div class="uk-modal-header">
        <h3 id="dialog-title">Having trouble logging in?</h3>
      </div>
      <p>If you are a student and cannot access your account, your password may have changed. Please use the <a href="https://passwordreset.microsoftonline.com" target="_blank" alt="Microsoft Self-Service Password Reset">Microsoft Self-Service Password Reset</a> portal to reset your password.</p>
      <p>If you have not previously enrolled in Self-Service Password Reset or need technical support, please contact the <a href="https://cecil.teamdynamix.com/TDClient/84/Portal/Home/" target="_blank" alt="Cecil College's IT Self-Service Portal">Cecil College IT Service Desk</a> for assistance.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
      <!-- Modal content for the Enroll For Spring/Fall Spotlight -->
    <div id="RegisterToday" class="uk-modal" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="dialog-title" tabindex="-1">
      <div class="uk-modal-dialog">
        <a class="uk-modal-close uk-close"></a>
        <div class="uk-modal-header">
          <h3 id="dialog-title">Enroll Today</h3>
        </div>
        <h4 class="uk-margin-bottom-remove">Course Information</h4>
        <p class="uk-margin-top-remove">For information about available courses, visit <a href="/programs-courses/academics/course-information">cecil.edu/courses</a>.</p>
        <h4 class="uk-margin-bottom-remove">Returning Students</h4>
        <p class="uk-margin-top-remove">Visit <a href="https://my.cecil.edu/ICS/Registration/Home.jnz?portlet=Course_Schedules&screen=Add+Drop+Courses&screenType=next" target="_blank">MyCecil</a> or visit the FAQ "How do I register for courses?" on the <a href="/student-resources/virtual-support">Virtual Support page</a> for hours and contact information to speak with a representative.</p>
        <h4 class="uk-margin-bottom-remove">New Students</h4>
        <p class="uk-margin-top-remove">Contact Admissions at (410) 287-1006, live chat during regular hours on the home page of cecil.edu, or email <a href="mailto:admissions@cecil.edu">admissions@cecil.edu</a>.</p>
        <h4 class="uk-margin-bottom-remove">First Day<sup>&reg;</sup> Complete</h4>
        <p class="uk-margin-top-remove">Learn about Barnes &amp; Noble College Bookstore’s First Day<sup>&reg;</sup> Complete program. Visit <a href="/campus-life/bookstore/first-day-complete-program">cecil.edu/firstday</a> for more information. If you have questions, please contact your bookstore team at (410) 287-5436 or <a href="mailto:bookstore@cecil.edu">bookstore@cecil.edu</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
